  "body": "Nestled in the heart of Silverdale, this impressive 2024-built residence offers the perfect blend of modern family living and exceptional investment potential. Positioned at 12 & 12A Blanc Road, the property sits on a freehold 1,138m² section, featuring a substantial 300m² (more or less) floor area within a highly sought-after Business Mixed Use Zone — offering outstanding flexibility and future opportunity.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a strategic location just moments from the Hibiscus Coast Bus Station and Northern Motorway, ensuring effortless commuting to Auckland’s CBD and surrounding areas. Silverdale Village and Silverdale Mall are within walking distance, placing shops, cafes, and essential amenities right at your doorstep, while Orewa Beach is just a short drive away for those weekend coastal escapes.\r\n\r\nThe main dwelling features 5 spacious bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, and multiple living and deck areas designed for relaxed family living and seamless indoor–outdoor entertaining. A 2-bedroom granny flat wing is cleverly integrated within the main home — ideal for extended family, guests, or additional rental income.\r\n\r\nAdding even more versatility, the property includes a fully self-contained, consented 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom minor dwelling with separate utility meters — perfect for extra income or accommodating larger families. \r\n\r\n(The minor dwelling is currently tenanted at $690 per week on a fixed term tenancy until early 2026 providing the potential buyers with immediate home and income)\r\n\r\nA lock-up garage, carport, and generous yard provide ample off-street parking for multiple vehicles.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a sunny northerly aspect, with expansive decks flowing from each living area — ideal for year-round entertaining. The home is Healthy Homes compliant, with certification available upon request.\r\n\r\nLocated within the Business Mixed Use Zone, this property offers a rare combination of comfortable living, home-business potential, and future development flexibility. Whether you’re looking for a premium multi-generational home or a smart investment with long-term upside, this Silverdale gem delivers on every level.",
